# Generated/fetched data — not source, regenerate locally by hitting the
# refresh API (see refresh.py / registry.py) rather than committing outputs.
# Keeps the repo code-only. Versioned layout is data/<name>/<version>.parquet
# and tiles/<name>/<version>.mbtiles now (registry.py + db.py), not the old
# flat data/*.parquet — ignore the whole per-dataset subtree either way.
data/*.parquet
data/*.geojson
data/*/
tiles/*.mbtiles
tiles/*/
registry.db
